; W2 dep spec for `--wrapper-requests`. The dep OWNS idx_foo / idx_bar (real structs) and produces
; IdxFooList STRUCTURALLY via the inline `[* idx_foo]` below — so a consumer's `[* idx_foo]` request
; is own-spec-produced-under-the-structural-name and emits nothing (satisfied by the existing class).
; The map / NonEmpty / nested wrappers the consumers request are NOT produced here, so the dep hosts
; them in requested_collections.rs.
idx_foo = [x: uint]
idx_bar = [y: tstr]

container = [items: [* idx_foo]]
